  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We have three options for station player mobility, immobilize, immobilize for vehicle, and mobile. A feature I would love to see added to the SDKs, (preferably sdk3) is a setting that would act similar to Mobile, where the player can move around freely, but the rotation of the station would apply to the player/avatar wherever they are in the world. Which would open up a lot of opportunities for things like faux gravity and changing player orientation in the world through the station.",
